    "text": "<p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi></math>&nbsp;is energy, then</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>E</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>E</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>r</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mi>&#955;</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>r</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>G</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>L</mi></mfenced></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>L</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>G</mi></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced></math></p><p>(both&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math>&nbsp;have dimensions of length)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><mi>G</mi></mfrac></msqrt><